Complaint status alone may overstate resolution when the same customer return=
s, the transaction remains unresolved or the account closes. The possible sto=
ries are that resolution notes are generic, that resolved complaints do not r=
ecur, or that specific categories lead to repeat contact or attrition.

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use September 2020 as the new evidence point rat=
her than recycling the earlier conclusion. There are enough data exceptions t=
o make a polished average dangerous; preserve the unresolved cases.

